418 | *foo **bar *baz* bim** bop* | <em>foo <strong>bar <em>baz</em> bim</strong> bop</em>
420 | ** is not an empty emphasis | ** is not an empty emphasis
421 | **** is not an empty strong emphasis | **** is not an empty strong emphasis

